---
layout: base.njk
trackId: apstats
title: "AP Statistics · ClipSAT"
description: "Collecting, analysing, and drawing conclusions from data"
isRtl: false
---
{#
  Renders from content/apstats/* (docs/CONTENT_MODEL.md) instead of the legacy
  {% include "tracks/apstats.html" %} — seventh track cut over, following the established pattern
  (docs/DECISIONS/0005-qudrat-cutover.md, 0006, 0007). index.html's aps-* sections and
  src/_includes/tracks/apstats.html are UNCHANGED and no longer read by this page, kept as the
  rollback path. build.js's MIGRATED_TRACKS set skips regenerating this file.

  Second track using the 'compact' practiceSet/testGenerator variant (appc was first) — confirms
  it's shared across College Board AP tracks, not appc-specific. Uses chapterTag's 'category'
  variant (not appc's 'pill') even though it shares appc's ap-tag/ap-wt class names — verified the
  real markup shape per track, didn't assume from the shared class name.
#}
{% set apstats = migratedContent.apstats %}
{% set pageHeader = apstats.meta.meta.pageHeader %}
<main id="view-apstats" class="view">
  {% include "partials/subject-head.njk" %}

  <div class="wrap calc-body">
    {% set chapters = apstats.chapters %}
    {% set practiceSetId = 'aps-practice' %}
    {% set testGeneratorId = 'aps-testgen' %}
    {% set downloadsId = 'aps-downloads' %}
    {% include "partials/rail.njk" %}

    <div class="content">
      {% for chapter in apstats.chapters %}
        {% include "partials/chapter.njk" %}
      {% endfor %}

      {% set sectionId = 'aps-practice' %}
      {% set practiceSet = apstats.practiceSet %}
      {% include "partials/practice-set.njk" %}

      {% set sectionId = 'aps-testgen' %}
      {% set testGenerator = apstats.meta.meta.testGenerator %}
      {% include "partials/test-generator.njk" %}

      {% set sectionId = 'aps-downloads' %}
      {% set courseMeta = apstats.meta.meta %}
      {% include "partials/downloads-block.njk" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
